{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>His email was unsettling. Why does he want me in Tokyo so badly?\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Everyone here feels like a shadow of themselves. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>They speak of the Membrane\u2014a boundary between reality and\u2026 something else. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It sounds crazy, but my nightmares feel closer every day. Maybe I should find something to help me sleep. I have to find him\u2014fast\u2014and never set foot here again.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And one more thing: ghosts don\u2019t exist\u2026 right?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Unravel the secrets of the Membrane, a hidden layer that haunts the darkest corners of Tokyo.</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this horror-adventure game, you play as Cam, searching for his brother who mysteriously disappeared in an enigmatic suburb of Tokyo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the city freely, uncover a deep and twisting storyline, collect clues, and unravel the secrets of the Membrane\u2014a mysterious layer above reality.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a dangerous world using only a single action button. Cam cannot fight the ghosts and monsters that lurk around every corner, so you\u2019ll need to hide, sneak, or escape to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique blend of adventure, point-and-click, and platforming gameplay, delivering an original and unconventional gaming experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in retro-inspired, hand-drawn graphics, influenced by cyberpunk classics and Japanese horror films and games.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as